        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SSP1210, 12 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Contemporary Pull is it a great choice for modern homes, the 12 inch square grip and beautiful, contemporary finishes will update any space. This 12 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull comes packaged with hardware to mount on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. This 12 Inch center to center door pull has a 13 inch overall length.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSP1210-specifications.gif?v=1704354504\" width=\"549\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" atl=\"Deltana SSP1210 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-12-inch-contemporary-pulls-pair-deltana-sspbb1210\"><b>Deltana SSPBB1210 Contemporary 12\" Back-to-Back Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Square Stainless Steel Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 2-1/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for glass, fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSP1210-specifciations.pdf?v=1704262342\"><b>Deltana SSP1210 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
